{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "Trie 把公共前缀复用为同一条路径，每个节点保存子节点，并用“单词结尾”标记区分完整单词与普通前缀。动画依次演示插入 apple、查询 apple/app、检查前缀 app，再插入 app 并重新查询。关键区别是：路径存在足以让 startsWith 返回 true，而 search 还要求最后节点已经被标记为单词结尾。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Trie 前缀树演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:grid;gap:8px}.panel,.status{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.calls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}.call{min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:12px}.call.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.call.done{border-color:#3794ff}.call .name,.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px}.call .out{font-size:10px;color:#b5cea8}.call.active .out{color:#fff}.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.box{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.label{color:#9cdcfe;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px}.big{font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4}.explain{line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}.tree{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.level{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:6px}.indent{width:calc(var(--depth)*16px);flex:0 0 auto}.edge{width:12px;flex:0 0 12px;border-top:1px solid #3c3c3c;margin-top:20px}.node{flex:1;min-height:48px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;padding:6px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:12px}.node.hidden-node{opacity:.22;border-style:dashed}.node.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.node.path{border-color:#3794ff}.char{font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;text-align:center}.depth{font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#9cdcfe}.end{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.end.yes{color:#4ec9b0;font-weight:600}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.swatch{width:12px;height:8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;margin-right:4px}.swatch.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.swatch.end{border-color:#4ec9b0}\n.tree .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 10px}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>示例调用序列</h2>\n<div class=\"calls\" id=\"calls\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"label\">当前操作</div><div class=\"big mono\" id=\"operation\">Trie()</div></div>\n<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"label\">判断依据</div><div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\">初始化只有根节点的前缀树。</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>树中状态</h2>\n<div class=\"tree\" id=\"tree\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"key\"><i class=\"swatch current\"></i>当前访问节点</span><span class=\"key\"><i class=\"swatch\"></i>已存在路径</span><span class=\"key\"><i class=\"swatch end\"></i>单词结尾为 true</span></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst callData=[['Trie()','null'],['insert(\"apple\")','null'],['search(\"apple\")','true'],['search(\"app\")','false'],['startsWith(\"app\")','true'],['insert(\"app\")','null'],['search(\"app\")','true']];\nconst calls=document.getElementById('calls');\ncallData.forEach((c,i)=>{const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='call';el.innerHTML='<span class=\"name\">'+c[0]+'</span><span class=\"out\">输出：<b>'+c[1]+'</b></span>';calls.appendChild(el)});\nconst letters=['根','a','p','p','l','e'];\nconst tree=document.getElementById('tree');\nletters.forEach((letter,i)=>{const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='level';row.style.setProperty('--depth',i);row.innerHTML='<span class=\"indent\"></span>'+(i?'<span class=\"edge\"></span>':'')+'<div class=\"node\" id=\"node'+i+'\"><span class=\"char\">'+letter+'</span><span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"depth\">深度 '+i+'</span><span class=\"end\" id=\"end'+i+'\">单词结尾：false</span></span></div>';tree.appendChild(row)});\nconst steps=[\n{call:0,op:'Trie()',at:0,exist:0,ends:[],text:'创建根节点；此时还没有保存任何字符。'},\n{call:1,op:'insert(\"apple\")：读取 a',at:1,exist:1,ends:[],text:'根节点下没有 a，创建新节点。'},\n{call:1,op:'insert(\"apple\")：读取第一个 p',at:2,exist:2,ends:[],text:'沿已有前缀继续创建第一个 p 节点。'},\n{call:1,op:'insert(\"apple\")：读取第二个 p',at:3,exist:3,ends:[],text:'相同字符出现在不同深度，对应两个不同节点。'},\n{call:1,op:'insert(\"apple\")：读取 l、e',at:5,exist:5,ends:[5],text:'补齐 l、e，并把 e 节点标记为单词结尾。'},\n{call:2,op:'search(\"apple\")',at:5,exist:5,ends:[5],path:5,text:'路径 a→p→p→l→e 完整存在，且终点标记为 true，所以返回 true。'},\n{call:3,op:'search(\"app\")',at:3,exist:5,ends:[5],path:3,text:'路径 app 虽然存在，但第二个 p 还不是单词结尾，所以返回 false。'},\n{call:4,op:'startsWith(\"app\")',at:3,exist:5,ends:[5],path:3,text:'前缀查询只要求路径存在，不检查结尾标记，因此返回 true。'},\n{call:5,op:'insert(\"app\")',at:3,exist:5,ends:[3,5],path:3,text:'路径已经存在，无需新建节点；只把第二个 p 标记为单词结尾。'},\n{call:6,op:'search(\"app\")',at:3,exist:5,ends:[3,5],path:3,text:'同一条 app 路径的终点现在已标记为 true，因此返回 true。'}\n];\nlet cursor=0;\nfunction render(s){\n document.getElementById('operation').textContent=s.op;\n document.getElementById('explain').textContent=s.text;\n [...calls.children].forEach((el,i)=>{el.classList.toggle('active',i===s.call);el.classList.toggle('done',i<s.call)});\n letters.forEach((_,i)=>{const node=document.getElementById('node'+i);node.className='node';if(i>s.exist)node.classList.add('hidden-node');if(s.path!==undefined&&i<=s.path)node.classList.add('path');if(i===s.at)node.classList.add('current');const end=document.getElementById('end'+i);const yes=s.ends.includes(i);end.textContent='单词结尾：'+(yes?'true':'false');end.className='end'+(yes?' yes':'')});\n}\nrender(steps[0]);\nsetInterval(()=>{cursor=(cursor+1)%steps.length;render(steps[cursor])},1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
